      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I went to church in Dubai yesterday (Palm Sunday) and the service was absolutely packed. Men, women, children, and noisy babies (including ours) from all over the world. \n\nEven with missles and drones flying overhead daily, people are keeping calm and carrying on. \ud83d\udc9c",
